*> Acceptance test, the contents of a thrown potion (docs/protocol/25 section 9.1 and 9.3, 17 section 3.15; lane itemcomp, T9605): a splash or lingering potion thrown by a player takes the effects of the
*> thrown stack's potion_contents (the potion's table rows, then the custom effects) into the thrown entity; a lingering potion keeps the duration scale 0.25; a water bottle has no effects.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-ITEMCOMP-POTIONS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY PLAYPKT.
 COPY PROJSTATE.
 COPY CSTACK.
 01 WS-PLAYER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CONN                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ITEM-ROW            PIC X(270).
 01 WS-ENTITY-ROW          PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SPLASH-ITEM         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LINGER-ITEM         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SPLASH-TYPE         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LINGER-TYPE         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DONE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROW                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PJ                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-HANDLE              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-POTION              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-EFFECT              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-AMP                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DUR                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E1                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E3                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E4                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E5                  PIC -(9)9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "MS-TEST-OPEN" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-CONN
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > CORE-MAX-CONNS
         IF CN-PLAYER(WS-I) = WS-PLAYER
             MOVE WS-I TO WS-CONN
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "minecraft:splash_potion" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-SPLASH-ITEM WS-ITEM-ROW WS-STATUS
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-SPLASH-TYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE "minecraft:lingering_potion" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-LINGER-ITEM WS-ITEM-ROW WS-STATUS
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-LINGER-TYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     COMPUTE WS-SLOT = PL-HELD(WS-PLAYER) + 1
     MOVE 0 TO PSB-HAND PSB-YAW PSB-PITCH

     MOVE "acceptance itemcomp 25-9 a thrown splash potion of turtle master with a custom effect carries all three effects" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-HANDLE
     MOVE 19 TO WS-POTION
     CALL "SC-POTION-SET" USING WS-HANDLE WS-POTION
     MOVE 11 TO WS-EFFECT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-AMP
     MOVE 100 TO WS-DUR
     CALL "SC-POTION-ADD-EFFECT" USING WS-HANDLE WS-EFFECT WS-AMP WS-DUR
     MOVE WS-SPLASH-ITEM TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     CALL "THROWN-ITEM-USE" USING WS-CONN PLAY-SERVERBOUND WS-DONE
     PERFORM FIND-THROWN
     MOVE PJ-FXN(WS-PJ) TO WS-E1
     MOVE PJ-FX-ID(WS-PJ, 1) TO WS-E2
     MOVE PJ-FX-DUR(WS-PJ, 2) TO WS-E3
     MOVE PJ-FX-ID(WS-PJ, 3) TO WS-E4
     MOVE PJ-SCALE(WS-PJ) TO WS-E5
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "n=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " first=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) " second dur=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) " third=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E4)
         " scale=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E5) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "n=3 first=1 second dur=400 third=11 scale=1000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance itemcomp 25-9 a lingering potion of healing keeps the 0.25 duration scale and its instant effect" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-HANDLE
     MOVE 24 TO WS-POTION
     CALL "SC-POTION-SET" USING WS-HANDLE WS-POTION
     MOVE WS-LINGER-ITEM TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     CALL "THROWN-ITEM-USE" USING WS-CONN PLAY-SERVERBOUND WS-DONE
     PERFORM FIND-LINGER
     MOVE PJ-FXN(WS-PJ) TO WS-E1
     MOVE PJ-FX-ID(WS-PJ, 1) TO WS-E2
     MOVE PJ-SCALE(WS-PJ) TO WS-E3
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "n=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " id=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) " scale=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "n=1 id=5 scale=250" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance itemcomp 25-9 a water bottle or a potion without a patch has no effects" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-HANDLE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-POTION
     CALL "SC-POTION-SET" USING WS-HANDLE WS-POTION
     MOVE WS-SPLASH-ITEM TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     CALL "THROWN-ITEM-USE" USING WS-CONN PLAY-SERVERBOUND WS-DONE
     PERFORM FIND-THROWN
     MOVE PJ-FXN(WS-PJ) TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-SPLASH-ITEM TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-PLAYER, WS-SLOT)
     CALL "THROWN-ITEM-USE" USING WS-CONN PLAY-SERVERBOUND WS-DONE
     PERFORM FIND-THROWN
     MOVE PJ-FXN(WS-PJ) TO WS-E2
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "0 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     STOP RUN.

*> The newest splash potion entity of the tracker (its PJ entry in WS-PJ).
 FIND-THROWN.
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ROW
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > EN-COUNT
         IF EN-USED(WS-I) = 1 AND EN-TYPE(WS-I) = WS-SPLASH-TYPE
             MOVE WS-I TO WS-ROW
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "PJ-FIND" USING EN-ID(WS-ROW) WS-PJ.

 FIND-LINGER.
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ROW
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > EN-COUNT
         IF EN-USED(WS-I) = 1 AND EN-TYPE(WS-I) = WS-LINGER-TYPE
             MOVE WS-I TO WS-ROW
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "PJ-FIND" USING EN-ID(WS-ROW) WS-PJ.

 CHECK.
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM ACC-ITEMCOMP-POTIONS.
 COPY MOBSPTEST.
 COPY CORETEST.
